      "en": "JetBrains Junie free model (GPT-6 Luna) in magpie: direct Responses API (no CLI needed) or CLI bridge; browser PKCE / CLI login reuse / perm-* key, multiple accounts.",
      "zh": "在 magpie 中使用 JetBrains Junie 免费模型（GPT-6 Luna）：直连 Responses API（无需 CLI）或 CLI 桥接；浏览器登录 / 复用本机 CLI 登录态 / perm-* key，支持多账号。"
    }
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  }
